---
import "../styles/global.css";
import site, { habitatSlug } from "../site.config";
const { title, description = site.tagline, image = site.heroImage } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pl">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <script is:inline>if(location.hostname.indexOf("www.")!==0 && location.hostname.endsWith("fotograf-przyrody.pl")){location.replace(location.href.replace("://","://www."));}</script>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title} · {site.name}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={`${title} · ${site.name}`} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={image} />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="pl_PL" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,500;0,8..60,700;1,8..60,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen terrain-grad font-sans text-fog antialiased">
    <header class="border-b border-fog/10">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-8">
        <a href="/" class="group">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-dusk">notatki z terenu</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fog md:text-5xl">{site.name}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-mist">{site.tagline}</p>
        </a>
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">
          <a href="/" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-fog/80 hover:bg-fog/10 hover:text-fog">Start</a>
          <a href="/kadry/" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-fog/80 hover:bg-fog/10 hover:text-fog">Kadry</a>
          <a href="/siedliska/" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-fog/80 hover:bg-fog/10 hover:text-fog">Siedliska</a>
          <a href="/o-autorze/" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-fog/80 hover:bg-fog/10 hover:text-fog">O autorze</a>
          <a href="/kontakt/" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-fog/80 hover:bg-fog/10 hover:text-fog">Kontakt</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <slot />
    <footer class="mt-24 border-t border-fog/10 bg-bark/40">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-fog">{site.name}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mist">{site.address}</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-dusk">Siedliska</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm">
            {site.habitats.map((h) => (
              <li><a class="text-mist hover:text-lichen" href={`/siedliska/${habitatSlug(h.name)}/`}>{h.name}</a></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-mist">
          <p>To nie jest katalog stockowych zachodu słońca. Piszę o tym, jak naprawdę wygląda praca w terenie — z błotem na butach i jedną udaną klatką na godzinę.</p>
          <p class="mt-4"><a href="/polityka-prywatnosci/" class="underline hover:text-lichen">Prywatność</a> · <a href="/regulamin/" class="underline hover:text-lichen">Regulamin</a></p>
          <p class="mt-2">© {new Date().getFullYear()} {site.name}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
